in{bmatrix}c \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$\n\nwhat is the value of $a + b + c$?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186162350 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186162093 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b21c27bd-5c7a-5645-93b5-0af73c59f685" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Solution to a Weighted Least-Squares Problem"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ad4f3bf0-0d8f-50b6-be6a-eaadc7e874d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186159303} {:answer/id #uuid "aeef2ab1-481b-5a7a-b1a4-c6f58e45b8e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186159304} {:answer/id #uuid "b5237a90-ff78-5ec4-9cfa-0b361b0d7830" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5}{3} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186159305} {:answer/id #uuid "bf2b6108-75cc-57a3-86f2-14df9bf1bcf9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186159306} {:answer/id #uuid "361acc04-0bf5-5e6e-8c6e-7c8726b17de3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5}{3} \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186159307}] :answer-field/id #uuid "2b32e7af-f493-5a95-b703-ec3b36a74b70" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186159302}] :question/id #uuid "f6bb363c-48b6-5047-89db-8e3fcc537bc7" :question/math-academy-id "q-137102" :question/problem "Find the solution for the weighted least-squares problem $WAx = Wb$, where\n\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}, b = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}, W = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186411867 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186162093 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b21c27bd-5c7a-5645-93b5-0af73c59f685" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Solution to a Weighted Least-Squares Problem"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "118a9ee1-aa44-5777-9118-5227ee29fe39" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411690} {:answer/id #uuid "343f47c9-bb05-5183-9f14-e8b4fa694501" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411704} {:answer/id #uuid "4d9f0f42-a4f1-5465-a3a2-7a60cda35ef3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411719} {:answer/id #uuid "8cb4a560-b34c-5ecb-b912-d45e89d2bc34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411753} {:answer/id #uuid "fd063dda-be76-5f0e-93fe-6561f604b438" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411817}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d9f0f42-a4f1-5465-a3a2-7a60cda35ef3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411719} :answer-field/id #uuid "4272bc52-3700-5a4c-920e-c054cf89452b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411825}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "9a9c63b9-55aa-5f88-8ff0-b14dd8c3b850" :question/math-academy-id "q-137889" :question/problem "Find the solution for the weighted least-squares problem $W\\,Ax=Wb,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,W=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "To get the normal equation corresponding to $W\\,Ax=Wb,$ we pre-multiply both sides of the equation by $(W\\,A)^{T}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(W\\,A)^{T}\\cdot W\\,Ax & =(W\\,A)^{T}\\cdot Wb \\\\ {A}^{T}({W}^{T}W)Ax & ={A}^{T}({W}^{T}W)b\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since\n\n$$\n{W}^{T}W=[\\begin{aligned}{1}^{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & {1}^{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & {2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nour normal equation can be written as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 8 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}17 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-15 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since the matrix on the left-hand side is invertible, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & ={[\\begin{aligned}17 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-15 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{17\\cdot 5-2\\cdot 2}[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 17\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-15 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{81}[\\begin{aligned}-81 \\\\ 81\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
